 and <code>database/migrations/109_commerce_ticket_delivery.sql</code>.</li><li>Return here and initialize the Commerce sandbox. Enable reserved-seat ticketing in its Configuration screen.</li></ol><p>These scripts add Commerce tables and protective triggers. They do not replace accounts, productions or existing ticket links. If an import has already been partially applied, review the existing tables and triggers before retrying.</p><?php endif;?><p><a href="<?=$b?>/admin/commerce">Check setup again</a> · <a href="<?=$b?>/admin/operations">Back to Operations</a></p></main></body></html><?php exit;
