 data-attr="restricted"> Restricted / obstructed view</label><label>Seating / marker description<textarea data-attr="description" maxlength="500"></textarea></label><button type="button" data-remove>Remove selected item</button></fieldset></section></div><fieldset '.($locked?'disabled':'').'><legend>Structure & bulk tools</legend><div class="commerce-columns"><section><h3>Sections and rows</h3><p>Keys preserve references. Edit names and display order below.</p><div data-structure></div><button type="button" data-add-section>Add section</button><button type="button" data-add-row>Add row</button></section><section><h3>Generate a row of seats</h3><label>Target row<select data-bulk-row></select></label><label>Count<input type="number" data-bulk-count min="1" max="50" value="8"></label><label>Starting seat number<input type="number" data-bulk-start min="1" value="1"></label><label>Starting X position<input type="number" data-bulk-x min="0" max="5000" value="60"></label><label>Seat spacing<input type="number" data-bulk-spacing min="24" max="200" value="52"></label><label>Angle in degrees<input type="number" data-bulk-angle min="-180" max="180" step="1" value="0"></label><p>0° is horizontal. Positive angles slope down to the right; negative angles slope up.</p><label>Row Y position<input type="number" data-bulk-y min="0" max="5000" value="140"></label><button type="button" data-generate>Generate seats</button><button type="button" data-rotate-row>Rotate existing row by this angle</button><h3>Add layout detail</h3><label>Item type<select data-new-kind><option value="aisle">Aisle</option><option value="space">Non-seat space</option><option value="stage">Stage</option><option value="interpreter">ASL interpreter position</option></select></label><button type="button" data-add-item>Add detail</button></section></div></fieldset>'.(!$locked?'<button type="submit">Save draft layout</button>':'').'</div></form>';
