oose your seats</h3><p><a href="#commerce-seat-list-heading">Skip map and choose from the seat list</a></p><div class="commerce-map-toolbar">';foreach(['in'=>'Zoom in','out'=>'Zoom out'] as $k=>$label)echo '<button type="button" data-select-zoom="'.$k.'">'.$label.'</button>';foreach(['left','right','up','down'] as $k)echo '<button type="button" data-select-pan="'.$k.'">Pan '.$k.'</button>';echo '<button type="button" data-select-fit>Fit layout</button></div><div data-seat-tooltip class="commerce-seat-tooltip" id="commerce-seat-tooltip" role="tooltip" hidden></div><div class="commerce-map-wrap"><svg class="commerce-map" data-select-map role="group" aria-label="Choose seats using the map or the seat list"></svg></div><p class="commerce-legend">Available: open circle · Selected: check mark · Held: H · Sold: S · Blocked/house/allocated: X · Wheelchair spaces: W. Hover or focus a seat for its number and details; touch users can use the seat list. Availability is also written beside every seat.</p><h3 id="commerce-seat-list-heading" tabindex="-1">Accessible seat list</h3><label><input type="checkbox" data-access-filter> Show wheelchair spaces and companion seats only</label><div class="commerce-seat-list">';
